# Anything we DON'T want streamed into the build context. The COPY . .
# step in the Dockerfile pulls everything not listed here into the image,
# so excluding node_modules / dist alone is what stops the image from
# carrying a 700 MB local-install duplicate of what `npm ci` produces
# fresh in-image.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
.npm
.cache
.claude
.playwright-cli
coverage
.env
.env.*
plugin/node_modules
local
# Playground local-mode assets — never shipped in the production image
# (docs/design/playground.md §13 step 6). oneshot.ts never loads them; this
# keeps the bytes out too.
plugin-local
src/local.ts
